ripts/gen_cli_reference.py --check` to verify the external CLI reference is regenerated from canonical parser help.\n- Run `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py tests/unit/test_gen_cli_reference.py -q` for the focused parser, help-generator, and import-documentation contracts.\n- Run `make lint` plus `make typecheck` for source checks.\n- Inspect the final diff to confirm that no importer runtime module changed.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Canonical import help describes current batching behavior.\n- [ ] Canonical import help describes deferred-push behavior.\n- [ ] `python scripts/gen_cli_help.py --check` confirms packaged help matches the canonical source.\n- [ ] `python scripts/gen_cli_reference.py --check` confirms the CLI reference matches the canonical source.\n- [ ] User guidance describes partial results.\n- [ ] User guidance describes supported serial rerun behavior.\n- [ ] Guidance promises no whole-file atomicity.\n- [ ] Guidance promises no automatic completion of partial tickets.\n- [ ] Concurrent-import limitations are explicit.\n- [ ] Focused parser assertions pass under `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py tests/unit/test_gen_cli_reference.py -q`.\n- [ ] Focused help-generator assertions pass under `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py tests/unit/test_gen_cli_reference.py -q`.\n- [ ] Focused import-documentation assertions pass under `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py tests/unit/test_gen_cli_reference.py -q`.\n- [ ] The final diff contains no importer runtime changes.\n- [ ] Import runtime behavior is unchanged.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/core/io.py","reason":"Correct canonical import help."},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/help/import.txt","reason":"Regenerate packaged import help."},{"path":"docs/cli-reference.md","reason":"Regenerate the external CLI reference."},{"path":"docs/import-export.md","reason":"Document batching, partial results, and recovery."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py","reason":"Pin current import help behavior through the generator."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","f7e4-4d33-f231-4774"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"f7e4-4d33-f231-4774","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["documentation","f10","import"],"ticket_id":"c679-d455-550e-4c02","ticket_type":"story","title":"F10 document import batching and partial recovery","verify_commands":[{"command":"python scripts/gen_cli_help.py --check","dd_id":"D1","dd_text":"Packaged CLI help is current"},{"command":"python scripts/gen_cli_reference.py --check","dd_id":"D2","dd_text":"Generated CLI reference is current"},{"command":"python -m pytest tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py tests/unit/test_gen_cli_reference.py -q","dd_id":"D3","dd_text":"Focused help generator contracts pass"},{"command":"make lint && make typecheck","dd_id":"D4","dd_text":"Source checks pass"}]},"source_event_uuids":["48704b62-83a6-41f3-9c4e-b7bd51b99c3b","da371ba4-bcf3-42c7-abd6-8b0cdd74a7de","4ae147bb-7e9d-4890-a029-73a87d9255cb","902568b0-adb4-4d31-84e6-41d7d8c679ad","fda68b5f-688f-4d8a-af2a-9b2e508b5965","46315a4b-27b1-4746-8e6e-5abb6f85528f"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787421922651658613,"uuid":"4b901d7f-a640-47c5-a359-a40bce5cc3df"}